              "content": "# Small golden: dot([1,1,1,1], [2,2,2,2]) == 8.0 (spec in reference.py / li-math).\n\nextern proc li_rt_volatile_sink_f64(v: float) -> unit\n  requires true\n  ensures true\n\ndef main() -> int\n  requires true\n  ensures result == 0\n  decreases 0\n=\n  var a: array[4, float]\n  var b: array[4, float]\n  var i: int = 0\n  while i < 4\n    a[i] = 1.0\n    b[i] = 2.0\n    i = i + 1\n  var s: float = a @ b\n  if s != 8.0:\n    return 1\n  li_rt_volatile_sink_f64(s)\n  return 0\n",
