              "content": "# Pure-Li horner loop — no LI_EXTRA_C; exercises BinOpFloat + while.\n\nextern proc li_rt_volatile_sink_f64(v: float) raises IO -> unit\n  requires true\n  ensures true\n\ndef main() raises IO -> int\n  requires true\n  ensures result == 0\n  decreases 0\n=\n  var x: float = 1.1\n  var acc: float = 0.0\n  var i: int = 0\n  while i < 5000000\n    acc = acc * x + 1.0\n    i = i + 1\n  li_rt_volatile_sink_f64(acc)\n  return 0\n",
