quired computation pattern.\n\nThe lookup table lut_a can be constructed using either a function with 256 conditional branches or a precomputed array of 256 floats. Initializing these tables once at the start of the loop is feasible, with a stack allocation of 256 * 2 floats being acceptable.\n\nFor building lut_a[k], the value is calculated as float(k) * 0.001, which requires casting integers to floats. While direct multiplication may cause precision issues, the golden implementation uses a while loop that adds 0.001 k times, though this approach is inefficient for larger n values like 10M.",
