          "text": "## wave-a-2i-explicit-math — done\n\n**PR:** https://github.com/li-langverse/lic/pull/176  \n**Branch:** `cursor/compiler-studio-plan-loop` (commit `dfd5b62`)\n\n### What changed\n\n1. **Broadcast policy (compiler + tests)**\n   - Typechecker error now states NumPy-style rank broadcast is unsupported.\n   - Added `compile_fail` specimens: `broadcast_numpy_reject_len2.li`, `broadcast_numpy_reject_pow_len2.li` (len-2 vs len-4 for `*` and `**`).\n   - Allowed forms unchanged: matching lengths, scalar×array, `array[1]`→`array[N]`.\n\n2. **Documentation**\n   - `docs/language/linear-algebra.md` — broadcast table, tensor/quaternion roadmap (`li-math` `Quat`, Phase 3 `tensor[...]`).\n   - `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-16-li-math-linalg-surface.md` — broadcast rules section.\n   - `docs/release-notes/2026-05-23-wave-a-2i-explicit-math.md`\n\n3. **Plan**\n   - `wave-a-2i-explicit-math` marked **completed** in `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-22-compiler-studio-plan-loop.md`.\n\n### Files touched\n\n| Path | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `compiler/types/typecheck.cpp` | Diagnostic text |\n| `li-tests/math_linalg/broadcast_numpy_reject_*.li` | New compile_fail tests |\n| `li-tests/manifest.toml` | Register tests |\n| `docs/language/linear-algebra.md` | Policy + tensor/quaternion path |\n| `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-16-li-math-linalg-surface.md` | Spec broadcast rules |\n| `CHANGELOG.md`, release notes, plan YAML | Tracking |\n\n### Tests run\n\n```bash\n./scripts/build.sh\n./li-tests/run_all.sh math_linalg          # 22 passed\n./scripts/verify-math-physics-goldens.sh\n./scripts/bench-verify-results.sh 1\n./scripts/compiler-studio-plan-gates.sh  # (earlier full run — passed)\n```\n\nNext plan-loop todo: `wave-a-7d-vectorized`."
