          "text": "## Deliverable\n\n**PR:** https://github.com/li-langverse/lic/pull/176  \n**Branch:** `cursor/compiler-studio-plan-loop` (pushed, commit `f996f79`)\n\n### What shipped (`wave-b-md-oracle`)\n\n1. **Plan doc** — `docs/benchmarks/competitive-engines-plan.md`  \n   - LAMMPS/GROMACS as `external_binary` CSV columns (`lammps`, `gromacs`)  \n   - Workload contract aligned with `md_core.h`  \n   - Roadmap B0→B3 (stub → real validity rows)\n\n2. **Oracle registry** — `benchmarks/competitive/md_oracle.toml`  \n   - Pinned versions, drivers, `workload_class = v0_micro`, `status = stub`\n\n3. **HPC registry** — `benchmarks/competitive/registry.toml`  \n   - `lammps_lj_micro` / `gromacs_lj_micro` on **watch** with `kernel_honesty = external_binary`\n\n4. **Stub driver**  \n   - `benchmarks/harness/md_external_oracle.py`  \n   - `benchmarks/tier2_physics/md_lennard_jones/external/run_oracle_stub.sh`  \n   - LAMMPS/GROMACS input skeletons + `pins.env.example`  \n   - Writes `benchmarks/results/md_lennard_jones/oracle_stub.json` (native `--verify` reference; no LAMMPS/GROMACS required in CI)\n\n5. **Tests / gates**  \n   - `li-tests/tooling/md_external_oracle_stub.sh` (wired into `hpc_competitive_registry.sh`)  \n   - `scripts/check-hpc-competitive.sh` validates `md_oracle.toml`\n\n6. **Plan YAML** — `wave-b-md-oracle` → **completed** in `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-22-compiler-studio-plan-loop.md`\n\n### Tests run\n\n```bash\n./scripts/check-hpc-competitive.sh\n./li-tests/tooling/md_external_oracle_stub.sh\n./scripts/compiler-studio-plan-gates.sh\n./scripts/verify-math-physics-goldens.sh\n./scripts/bench-verify-results.sh 1\n```\n\nAll passed after `./scripts/build.sh`.\n\n### Next (B1/B2, not this slice)\n\n- LAMMPS deck matching FCC+MB IC → `lang=lammps` validity row in `latest.csv`  \n- GROMACS `gmx mdrun` micro → `lang=gromacs` validity row"
