          "text": "## Deliverable\n\n**PR:** https://github.com/li-langverse/lic/pull/176  \n**Branch:** `cursor/compiler-studio-plan-loop` (pushed at `6bc7514`)\n\n### What changed\n\nTier-2 physics verification was failing because Li drivers did not emit checksums for the harness. This slice:\n\n1. **`verify.py`** — Runs tier-0 compile checks plus tier-2 smokes for `md_lennard_jones` and `heat_equation_2d` (native build, Li build, checksum parity).\n2. **`md_lennard_jones/li/main.li`** — Restored the C-kernel driver (`li_md_kernel` + `li_md_checksum`) with `li_rt_volatile_sink_f64`.\n3. **`heat_equation_2d/li/main.li`** — Same checksum-sink pattern for the PDE smoke.\n4. **`bench.py`** — Dropped `li_pure=True` on MD so it uses the shared `md_core.c` kernel (matches `PERF.md`).\n5. **`compiler-studio-plan-gates.sh`** — Added a tier-2 `verify.py` phase.\n6. **`li-tests/tooling/tier2_physics_verify_smoke.sh`** — Standalone gate script.\n7. **Plan todo** `wave-b-tier2-verify` → **completed**\n\n### Tests run (all green)\n\n```bash\npython3 benchmarks/harness/verify.py\n./scripts/verify-math-physics-goldens.sh\n./scripts/bench-verify-results.sh 1\n./scripts/compiler-studio-plan-gates.sh\n```\n\n### Files touched\n\n- `benchmarks/harness/verify.py`\n- `benchmarks/harness/bench.py`\n- `benchmarks/tier2_physics/md_lennard_jones/li/main.li`\n- `benchmarks/tier2_physics/heat_equation_2d/li/main.li`\n- `scripts/compiler-studio-plan-gates.sh`\n- `li-tests/tooling/tier2_physics_verify_smoke.sh`\n- `docs/release-notes/2026-05-23-wave-b-tier2-verify.md`\n- `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-22-compiler-studio-plan-loop.md`"
